scenario 2
tick_rate 25
# BUG-008: a ranged skill cast at a monster must play in place; the
# character never walks or dashes toward the monster.
name bug-008-cast-in-place
seed 1234
end 40
# A level 30 Sorceress with Fire Ball (skill 47) at 20 on the right button.
char class 1
char level 30
char skill 47 20
char hand right 47
# The Blood Moor, at the level's start, with mana refilled every tick (god)
# so the cast never stops for mana.
char area 0 2
char at 5143 4263
at 0 dev god on
# A Fallen pack (monstats row 19) 12 sub-tiles east of the player.
at 1 spawn 19 @x+12 @y normal
# Right-click the nearest Fallen: Fire Ball at it.
at 8 input rclickunit 1 19
# She stays on her spot before, during and after the cast; the click goes
# out as a skill on a unit (0x0D) and the cast plays.
at 8 check player.pos ~ (5143, 4263) 0
at 12 check player.pos ~ (5143, 4263) 0
at 16 check player.pos ~ (5143, 4263) 0
by 20 check sent(0x0D) >= 1
by 20 check player.mode == cast
at 24 check player.pos ~ (5143, 4263) 0
at 40 check player.pos ~ (5143, 4263) 0
